DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The backlight driver provides a generic way for handling a panel back‐
     light.

     Drivers for backlight system register themselves globally using the
     bbaacckklliigghhtt__rreeggiisstteerr() function.  They must define two methods,
     BBAACCKKLLIIGGHHTT__GGEETT__SSTTAATTUUSS() which is used to query the current brightness
     level and BBAACCKKLLIIGGHHTT__SSEETT__SSTTAATTUUSS() which is used to update it.

